#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 2699 0>が姿を現した！
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 1 2699 1 1 1></capitalize> greift dich an!
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr BNpcName 1 2699 1 1></capitalize> a fait son apparition<nbsp>!
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/013/BanKob205_01339:TEXT_BANKOB205_01339_POPMESSAGE_000_000:1"
msgid "The big shrapnel strikes!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EObj 2003745 0>から敵が飛びだした！！
#. de: Aus <noun-de EObj 2 2003745 1 3 1> fliegt ein Feind auf dich zu!
#. fr: Un ennemi a surgi <noun-fr EObj 9 2003745 1 1><nbsp>!
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/013/BanKob205_01339:TEXT_BANKOB205_01339_POPMESSAGE_000_001:1"
msgid "There is a rush of heat from among the embers!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: その行動は出現した敵を倒さないと実行できません
#. de: Du musst erst alle Gegner besiegen!
#. fr: Action impossible. Vous devez d'abord abattre tous les ennemis.
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/013/BanKob205_01339:TEXT_BANKOB205_01339_POPMESSAGE_000_002:1"
msgid "Fight first, reap later!"
msgstr ""

